Healthcare Patient Readmission Analysis
📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing hospital patient data to identify the key factors causing frequent patient readmissions. The analysis helps healthcare management improve patient care, reduce readmission rates, optimize treatment costs, and monitor doctor performance.

The project includes:

• Data Cleaning
• Exploratory Data Analysis
• Data Visualization
• Healthcare Insights
• Business Recommendations

🎯 Problem Statement

Hospitals face challenges with repeated patient admissions. This project aims to:

✅ Identify diseases with high readmission rates
✅ Analyze patient age patterns
✅ Evaluate doctor recovery performance
✅ Study treatment cost impact on recovery
✅ Generate healthcare management insights

📂 Dataset Information

The dataset contains:

• Patient ID
• Age
• Disease
• Admission Date
• Readmission Status
• Treatment Cost
• Doctor Assigned
• Recovery Days

